4870","volume":"48","author":"X Liu","year":"2021","unstructured":"Liu, X. et al. European carbon uptake has not benefited from vegetation greening. Geophys. Res. Lett. 48, 1641\u20131650 (2021).","journal-title":"Geophys. Res. Lett."},{"key":"1270_CR39","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"70","DOI":"10.1038\/s41558-020-00944-0","volume":"11","author":"J Loisel","year":"2021","unstructured":"Loisel, J. et al. Expert assessment of future vulnerability of the global peatland carbon sink. Nat. Clim. Chang. 11, 70\u20137 (2021).","journal-title":"Nat. Clim. Chang."},{"key":"1270_CR40","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"55","DOI":"10.1038\/s43017-021-00230-3","volume":"3","author":"KR Miner","year":"2022","unstructured":"Miner, K. R. et al. Permafrost carbon emissions in a changing Arctic. Nat. Rev. Earth Environ. 3, 55\u201367 (2022).","journal-title":"Nat. Rev. Earth Environ."},{"key":"1270_CR41","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"927","DOI":"10.3390\/rs5020927","volume":"5","author":"Z Zhu","year":"2013","unstructured":"Zhu, Z. et al. Global Data Sets of Vegetation Leaf Area Index (LAI)3g and Fraction of Photosynthetically Active Radiation (FPAR)3g Derived from Global Inventory Modeling and Mapping Studies (GIMMS) Normalized Difference Vegetation Index (NDVI3g) for the Period 1981 to 2011. Remote Sens. 5, 927\u2013948 (2013).","journal-title":"Remote Sens."},{"key":"1270_CR42","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"243","DOI":"10.1016\/j.rse.2004.01.002","volume":"90","author":"JS Kimball","year":"2004","unstructured":"Kimball, J. S., McDonald, K. C., Running, S. W. & Frolking, S. E. Satellite radar remote sensing of seasonal growing seasons for boreal and subalpine evergreen forests. Remote Sens. Environ. 90, 243\u2013258 (2004).","journal-title":"Remote Sens. Environ."},{"key":"1270_CR43","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","first-page":"472","DOI":"10.1016\/j.rse.2012.02.014","volume":"121","author":"Y Kim","year":"2012","unstructured":"Kim